mary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 2"}, {"id": 1550336, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/1162/images/gallery/3_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 3"}, {"id": 1550337, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/1162/images/gallery/4_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 4"}], "campgroundId": 1162, "hasOnlineStore": false, "campgroundName": "Jetty Park", "primaryAddress": {"address1": "9035 Campground Circle", "address2": null, "city": "Cape Canaveral", "stateProvince": "FL", "zipCode": "32920"}, "phone": "+1 321-783-7111", "email": "jpreservations@portcanaveral.com", "lat": "28.40686", "lon": "-80.59450", "facebookUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/JettyParkBeachandCampground/", "twitterId": "", "pinterestUrl": null, "instagramUrl": "jettyparkfla", "description": "Jetty Park Campground is an oasis by the ocean where guests from all around the world come to share in a one-of-a-kind experience. Because of the campgrounds unique location nestled along the Atlantic Ocean and inside beautiful Port Canaveral, it's not uncommon to see one or all of the following: \n<p>\n</p><p></p><ul><li>Cruise ships arriving/departing \n</li><li>Submarines arriving/departing \n</li><li>Rocket launches from Cape Canaveral Space Force Station  \n</li><li>Wildlife and marine life \n</li></ul><p></p><p>The park offers guests a variety of camping options from tent camping in a rustic site to relaxing in your RV with all the amenities included.  \n</p><p>So, with all the reasons to stay at Jetty Park Campground, come and camp with us!  We look forward to your visit. See you soon!</p><p> \n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n</p>", "events": "As a gateway to Central Florida and with more recreational opportunities than all other Florida ports combined, we have an abundance of options for turning an idle hour, day or week into a transforming experience! \n<p>\n</p><p> \n</p><p>\n</p><p>The Cove is a waterfront recreation area at Port Canaveral with restaurants, charter boats, and cruise ships. Many Cove restaurants have outdoor seating and are great locations for watching cruise ships sail by and rockets launching into space. All of this is within minutes of Jetty Park Campground. For more information&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.portcanaveral.com/home\">click here</a>.</p><p>Visit Kennedy Space Center in Cape Canaveral. Take a bus ride out to the Saturn V Center and view a life size Saturn V Rocket. Then, walk around the home of the space shuttle Atlantis. </p><p>\n</p><p> \n</p><p>\n</p>"}, "dates": {"2026-10-20": {"status": 200, "open": [370095, 370094, 370093, 370092, 370091, 370090, 370089, 370088, 370087, 370086, 370085, 370084, 370083, 370082]}, "2026-10-17": {"status": 200, "open": [370094, 370093, 370092, 370091, 370090, 370089, 370088, 370087, 370086, 370085, 370084, 370083, 370082]}, "2027-01-26": {"status": 200, "open": [370095, 370094, 370093, 370092, 370091, 370090, 370089, 370088, 370087, 370086, 370085, 370084, 370083, 370082]}, "2027-01-30": {"status": 200, "open": [370095, 370094, 370093, 370092, 370091, 370090, 370089, 370088, 370087, 370086, 370085, 370084, 370083, 370082]}, "2027-06-08": {"status": 200, "open": [370095, 370094, 370093, 370092, 370091, 370090, 370089, 370088, 370087, 370086, 370085, 370084, 370083, 370082]}, "2027-06-12": {"status": 200, "open": [370095, 370094, 370093, 370092, 370091, 370090, 370089, 370088, 370087, 370086, 370085, 370084, 370083, 370082]}}, "sites": {"370094": {"description": "Rentals are available 7AM-9PM. For day use only. When reserving this pavilion, choose arrival date and the following day as the departure date.  No electricity. No generators. 8 picnic tables including an ADA picnic table. Holds up to 65 people. Includes one free parking pass, all other vehicles must pay entry fee.